I left out the `http-client` import. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and this one grants only `inference-llm`. Adding a fetch that sends the untrusted feed text to an external URL would be an unlisted capability and an exfiltration path, so I kept the node confined to what the graph declares. When the graph adds `http-client`, that change should go through the graph definition, and I can add the call then.

